<title>UK: Conrad Ritblat buys property, makes cash call.</title>
<headline>Conrad Ritblat buys property, makes cash call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conrad Ritblat Group Plc said on Thursday that it plans to buy a property in London for 10 million stg and raise 10.3 million stg via a rights issue.</p>
<p>Chairman John Ritblat said in a statement, &quot;The proposed acquisition of this property, on which we have developed plans for refurbishment, represents a further high quality addition to our property portfolio. We are confident that rental prospects for a refurbished building of this nature are propitious.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
